    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276296</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>お待たせです！
え……と、黒い人ー！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hey, we're back!
U-Um... Black maaan!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276388</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>おおっ！　待っていたよ！
で、どうかね？いけそうかね？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ooh! I've been waiting for you!
So, how about it? Can you do it?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276448</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ちょっと待っててください</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yes, just give me a moment.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276496</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>よしっ……と</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Alright... Ready.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276572</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>うおっ！
……君、本当に転移できるんだね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Whoa! ...You really can
hop dimensions, huh.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276656</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>うわっ！　狭い！
……そちらも本当に、
真っ黒ですね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Whoa! It's such a tight fit
down here! ...And it really
is pitch black, isn't it.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276760</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そ、そうかね？
と、ところで狭いので、
早くしてもらえると助かるのだが</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I-Is it? W-Well, um, since it's such
a tight fit, I'd be very grateful
if you could make it quick.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276932</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そうですね。
しかし、別の世界なんて
うまくいくのかな？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Good idea. I hope we'll
be able to reach the
other world from here...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276932</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>まあ、とりあえず……
すみません、あなたの世界を
イメージして、これを握ってください</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, first things first... Ah, sorry.
Could you hold onto this while
picturing the world you're from?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276980</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>こう、かね？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh, like this?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277056</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……！
そ、そこじゃないです。
この剣です</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...! N-No, not
there. Um.
The sword.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277152</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>い、いや、すまない。
わたしとしたことが。
では、こう、かね？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>A-Ah, sorry.
My mistake.
Then, like this?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277212</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……行きますよ。
むんっ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Okay, we're going. Hooo...!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277264</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……………………</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277316</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……………………</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277360</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ただいま</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'm back.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277412</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>び、びっくりした！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>W-Whoa! You surprised me!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277516</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>もうっ！　後ろに現れるなら
そうと言ってください</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>If you're going to show up
behind us, at least tell us first!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277516</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……で、どうでした？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...So, how did it go?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277644</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>うん、何とかうまく行ったよ。
別の世界がイメージできないから、
普段じゃムリなんだろうけど、ね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah, it worked out somehow. But
it's hard to imagine other worlds,
so it normally doesn't go so well.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277696</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そうか、よかった～</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Huh... Well, that's good~</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277780</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>すみません。&lt;Cless&gt;さん。
手伝ってもらっちゃって</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Sorry, &lt;Cless&gt;. Having
you do all this for us.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277868</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ああ、そうそう。
社長さんから、
&lt;Mel&gt;ちゃんにお礼だよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ahh, right, right. The
President wanted you
to have this as thanks.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278048</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>社長さん？　私に？
ああ、あの人どこかの
社長さんだったんですか</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>President? For me?
Oh, um, so that person is
a president of somewhere?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>24</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278048</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>でも、お礼だなんて。
わたし今回何もしてないのに。
それなら&lt;Cless&gt;さんのほうが……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But, as thanks to me? I didn't
do anything this time. You're
the one who should have it, &lt;Cless&gt;...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>24</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278164</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あ、ああ、いや。ぼ、僕のほうは
いいんだ。それに、女の子用の
ステージ衣装みたいだし</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ah, w-well, yeah. I-I'm f-fine,
really. And that's a stage
costume for girls, anyway.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>26</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278228</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>すみません。
じゃあ、遠慮なく</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh, sorry. Then,
I'll accept it.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>27</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278316</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ステージ衣装って、
あの人、何の社長さんだったんだ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>"Stage costume"? So, wait,
what's he president of?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>28</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278436</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>それはパーフェクトに
ワンダリングなミッシングだから
勝手に触んな、このハゲぼうず！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Those are Missing and Wandering
Perfect-ly, so don't ya dare lay
a hand on 'em, ya numbskull!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>29</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278636</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>しっかし、パンスト野郎よぉ、
おめぇ、もしやお礼にとか言って
ライブに行って来ただな？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Anyway, you, ya tights-wearing jerk.
Ya didn't happen to get invited to a live
concert, did ya? As "thanks" for the help?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>30</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278636</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>まんず、チケットが取れねぇ
プレミアーンなライブによ？
あ？　あ？　そうだべ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Maybe even one of those real premium
concerts ya can't even get tickets for,
normally? Huh? Huh? I'm right, ain't I?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>30</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278740</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>え！？
いや……そ、そんな？　そもそも、
すぐに帰ってきたじゃないか！？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Eh!? Uh, no, I-I didn't...
I mean, I came back
right away, didn't I!?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>32</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278960</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ふん！　時空転移使っただ！
んなもん幾らでもごまかせるべ！
おめぇなら、やりかねんだーよ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hmph! Ya just time traveled! There's
a whole lot of tricks ya can play with
that! Not a chance ya wouldn't use it!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>33</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278960</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あーあ、自分だけずるいんだ～！
おらも、おらも行きたかったな！
ふたごちゃんを応援したいだ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ahhh, can't believe ya went on
your own~! I wanted to go, too!
To cheer on my lovely twins!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>33</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279056</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そうなのかい？
ぼくはどっちかっていうと
あずささんのほうが……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Huh, really? If I
had to pick, I like
Azusa-chan best.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>35</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279108</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>何の話？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What are you talking about?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>36</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279168</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>なんでもない！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Nothing at all!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>37</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
